OL,3,ACivil servant wore make up so he could
OL,4,Ajuggle five jobs from home, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA civil servant is accused of earning
OL,7,Falmost #350,000 a year by juggling five
OL,8,Ffull-time public sector roles - using
OL,9,Fsick notes and working from home to
OL,10,Fcope with the workload.
OL,12,FKashim Chowdhury allegedly held
OL,13,Fmultiple government jobs between
OL,14,FFebruary 2020 and September 2023.
OL,16,FThe jury at Southwark Crown Court has
OL,17,Fbeen told he wore white make up during
OL,18,Fa video call with his boss to try to
OL,19,Flook ill, but the makeup began peeling
OL,20,Foff his skin.
