OL,3,ACivil servant wore make up so he could
OL,4,Ajuggle five jobs from home, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FChowdury, a 55-year-old from east
OL,7,FLondon, is on trial accused of nine
OL,8,Fcounts of fraud, which he denies. He
OL,9,Fdenies acting dishonestly or intending
OL,10,Fto make a dishonest gain.
